WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
If you take medication for seizures, please take it as scheduled on the morning of your

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.120
procedure with a small sip of water, unless your doctor's office has told you otherwise.

3
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.060
It is very important not to skip seizure medication without explicit guidance from your care

4
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.420
team.

5
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:19.120
If you have any uncertainty about your dosing instructions, please call your doctor's

6
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.420
office before your appointment time.

7
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:25.240
Your safety is the priority, and they want to make sure your medication routine is handled

8
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.600
correctly before you arrive.
